---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Saint-Paul-Emard"
  description="Saint-Paul-Emard — Secteur 01, enclave active DeadMTL. Hiver 1993–1994. Pas sécurisé. Pas perdu."
>

<!-- ─── PAGE BBS BAR ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page-bbs-bar" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="pbb__seg pbb__seg--active">Dossier Sectoriel</span>
  <span class="pbb__seg">Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard</span>
  <span class="pbb__seg">Secteur 01</span>
  <span class="pbb__seg pbb__seg--sys">Actif — Zone MVP</span>
  <span class="pbb__spacer"></span>
  <span class="pbb__ref">MTL-SUD-OUEST // HIVER 93/94</span>
</div>

<!-- ─── BBS BLOCK ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="bbs-block" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="bbs__line bbs__line--header">DOSSIER: SAINT-PAUL-&Eacute;MARD &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; SECTEUR 01 &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ENCLAVE ACTIVE &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; LASALLE PRESSURE NORD</div>
  <div class="bbs__line bbs__line--system">CLASSIFICATION: MVP ZONE &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ACC&Egrave;S: LECTURE SEULEMENT &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; HIVER 1993&ndash;1994</div>
  <div class="bbs__line bbs__line--warn">AVERT: PAS S&Eacute;CURIS&Eacute; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; PAS PERDU &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; POINT D&rsquo;ENTR&Eacute;E &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; LISTE BLANCHE FERM&Eacute;E</div>
</div>

<!-- ─── PAGE HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="term-hero" style="padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);">
  <div class="th__inner hero-split">

    <!-- Left: identity -->
    <div>
      <div class="th__eyebrow">SECTEUR 01 // ENCLAVE ACTIVE // HIVER 1993&ndash;1994</div>

      <div class="th__headline" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);">
        Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard
      </div>
      <div class="th__sub" style="font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);">
        Premier secteur enclos de DeadMTL.
      </div>

      <p class="th__body">
        Montr&eacute;al est morte par morceaux. Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard est le premier
        morceau encore g&eacute;rable. Il unit Ville-&Eacute;mard et
        C&ocirc;te-Saint-Paul en une seule identit&eacute; de secteur DeadMTL.
        Pas s&eacute;curis&eacute;. Pas perdu. C&rsquo;est le point d&rsquo;entr&eacute;e.
      </p>

      <div class="th__cta">
        <a href="/"              class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">&larr; Accueil</a>
        <a href="/dispatch/"     class="term-btn term-btn--teal">Canal Dispatch &rsaquo;</a>
        <a href="/map/"          class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">Carte R&eacute;gionale &rsaquo;</a>
        <a href="/construction/" class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">Statut Saison 0 &rsaquo;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: ASCII locator -->
    <div aria-hidden="true" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:1rem;">
      <div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.58rem; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:0.5rem;">LOCALISATION SECTORIELLE</div>
        <div class="ascii-locator">
          <div class="al__grid">
            <div class="al__cell">STH</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">CSP</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--hot">JOL</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">CVL</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--loc">S-P-E</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--hot">LAS</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">CAN</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">VEM</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--hot">ANG</div>
          </div>
          <span class="al__caption">S-P-E &bull; 45°27&rsquo;N 73°35&rsquo;O</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.3rem;">
        {[
          { label: 'Lasalle',   pct: 78,  mod: 'crit' },
          { label: 'Jolicoeur', pct: 52,  mod: 'hot' },
          { label: 'P.Mercier', pct: 100, mod: 'sealed' },
        ].map(z => (
          <div class="zone-bar">
            <span class="zb__label">{z.label}</span>
            <div class="zb__track">
              <div class={`zb__fill zb__fill--${z.mod}`} style={`width:${z.pct}%`}></div>
            </div>
            <span class={`zb__pct zb__pct--${z.mod}`}>{z.pct === 100 ? 'SELL' : z.pct + '%'}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTOR STATUS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow eyebrow--accent">Sector Dossier</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Status Overview</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Filed under active MVP zone. All data reflects current season conditions.
    </p>

    <div class="dossier-grid">
      <div class="dossier-stat dossier-stat--active">
        <div class="stat__label">Status</div>
        <div class="stat__value">Active MVP Zone</div>
      </div>
      <div class="dossier-stat">
        <div class="stat__label">Season</div>
        <div class="stat__value">Winter 1993&ndash;1994</div>
      </div>
      <div class="dossier-stat dossier-stat--warn">
        <div class="stat__label">Threat Level</div>
        <div class="stat__value">Fragmented</div>
      </div>
      <div class="dossier-stat">
        <div class="stat__label">Access</div>
        <div class="stat__value">Quarantine Lines</div>
      </div>
      <div class="dossier-stat">
        <div class="stat__label">Role</div>
        <div class="stat__value">Entry Enclave</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="status-banner">
      <span class="banner__label">Quarantine</span>
      <span class="banner__text">
        Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard is the only open sector. All neighboring districts
        remain behind quarantine lines. Expansion follows evidence on the ground.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── BOUNDARIES ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Perimeter</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Sector Boundaries</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      The playable square. What holds the enclave together and what presses against it.
    </p>

    <div class="boundary-grid">
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">North</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">
          Canal de Lachine and the Saint-Patrick pressure corridor.
          Industrial banks, cold water, limited crossings.
          Saint-Henri visible on the far side.
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">West</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">
          Angrignon approach and the LaSalle line.
          Open ground feeds movement in from the south.
          The Mercier corridor bleeds pressure here continuously.
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">South</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">
          Canal de l&rsquo;Aqueduc and the Verdun edge.
          Closed pockets. Civilian debris. Survivor-held blocks
          that do not welcome unknown arrivals.
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">East</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">
          C&ocirc;te-Saint-Paul industrial corridors and autoroute structures.
          Rail lines, viaducts, high walls, dead-end approaches.
          Later route toward Pointe-Saint-Charles and central Montreal.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── INTERNAL SUBZONES ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Internal Structure</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Subzones</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard is not one thing. Four distinct subzones with
      different threat profiles and different reasons to enter.
    </p>

    <div class="subzone-grid">

      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--medium">
        <div class="sub__name">Monk Residential</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">
          Duplexes, ruelles, corner shops, boarded windows, buried caches.
          The streets are navigable. Most buildings are accessible.
          Some residents stayed. Some of them are still moving.
          First loot. First decisions. Recoverable if approached carefully.
        </p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: Medium &mdash; Recoverable</span>
      </div>

      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--unstable">
        <div class="sub__name">Jolicoeur Barrier</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">
          A failed civilian triage point. Buses repositioned as barricades.
          Improvised blockades that stopped nothing but blocked everything.
          Exits compromised. Navigation requires patience.
          The cluster of dead near the old bus lines did not disperse.
        </p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: Unstable &mdash; Active Cluster</span>
      </div>

      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--high">
        <div class="sub__name">Canal Edge</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">
          Cold industrial strip along the waterline.
          Workshops, garages, shipping containers, fog off the canal.
          Useful loot. High risk. The movement here comes from the north bank
          and does not follow predictable patterns.
        </p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: High &mdash; Industrial Corridor</span>
      </div>

      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--mobile">
        <div class="sub__name">Angrignon Fringe</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">
          Open green buffer at the western edge. Abandoned camps.
          Good sightlines that cut both ways. Migration flow from LaSalle
          brings pressure that is mobile, not stationary.
          The open ground feels safer than it is.
        </p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: Mobile &mdash; Unpredictable</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── NEIGHBOR PRESSURE ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">External Situation</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Neighboring Pressure Zones</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Districts that define the situation inside Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard
      without being accessible yet. They shape what enters, what does not,
      and what is coming.
    </p>

    <div class="district-grid">

      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">LaSalle</div>
        <p class="card__desc">
          Mercier pressure. The bridge barricade failed in week one.
          Major horde source. Not an early zone.
        </p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--critical">Critical</span>
      </div>

      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Verdun</div>
        <p class="card__desc">
          Closed pockets, survivor rationing, contested access.
          Smuggling routes active. Entry requires negotiation.
        </p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--contested">Contested</span>
      </div>

      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Saint-Henri</div>
        <p class="card__desc">
          Canal crossings, workshops, industrial loot.
          The north bank is contested. Every crossing point costs something.
        </p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--contested">Contested</span>
      </div>

      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Pointe-Saint-Charles</div>
        <p class="card__desc">
          Rails and viaducts. Autoroute corridors.
          Later route toward central Montreal. Not yet reachable.
        </p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--tense">Tense</span>
      </div>

      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Angrignon</div>
        <p class="card__desc">
          False calm. The park is open land, abandoned camps,
          moving dead. No anchored threat. Constant drift.
        </p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--buffer">Buffer</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── ACCESS GATES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Perimeter Control</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Access Gates</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Designated crossing points. All currently restricted. Status reflects
      last confirmed field report, winter 1993&ndash;1994.
    </p>

    <div class="gate-list">
      <div class="gate-item">
        <span class="gate__id">Gate A</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Monk North Crossing</span>
        <span class="gate__status gate__status--locked">Locked</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gate-item">
        <span class="gate__id">Gate B</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Angrignon West Line</span>
        <span class="gate__status gate__status--unstable">Unstable</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gate-item">
        <span class="gate__id">Gate C</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Aqueduct South Cut</span>
        <span class="gate__status gate__status--watched">Watched</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gate-item">
        <span class="gate__id">Gate D</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Industrial East Corridor</span>
        <span class="gate__status gate__status--blocked">Blocked</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gate-item">
        <span class="gate__id">Gate E</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Canal Service Route</span>
        <span class="gate__status gate__status--limited">Limited</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── GAMEPLAY ROLE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="eyebrow">Server Design</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Gameplay Role</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      What Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard does in the server world. Not a tutorial.
      A district that happens to be survivable enough to start in.
    </p>

    <ul class="gameplay-list">
      <li>Starting district for all Season 0 players. Entry point into the server world.</li>
      <li>Early scavenging across Monk Residential and Canal Edge subzones.</li>
      <li>First contact with the Jolicoeur Barrier situation and its locked exits.</li>
      <li>First Dispatch events originate here before expanding outward.</li>
      <li>Faction rumors surface through player interactions and dispatch posts.</li>
      <li>Map expansion hooks: Saint-Henri canal crossings, Verdun smuggling, LaSalle pressure.</li>
      <li>Tutorial progression without tutorial framing. Learn by surviving, not by prompts.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── DISPATCH HOOKS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Incoming Signal</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Dispatch Hooks</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      First dispatch entries filed from Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard.
      Read the full transmission for each event.
    </p>

    <div class="hook-grid">

      <a class="hook-card" href="/dispatch/signal-monk/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block;">
        <div class="hook__signal">&#x25A0; Signal Inbound</div>
        <div class="hook__title">Signal Monk</div>
        <p class="hook__desc">
          Something is broadcasting from deep inside the Monk Residential block.
          Short-range, irregular. Could be a survivor. Could be a looped recording.
          Could be bait. The signal stops at dawn.
        </p>
        <span class="hook__tag">Monk Residential &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a class="hook-card" href="/dispatch/canal-cache/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block;">
        <div class="hook__signal">&#x25A0; Cache Report</div>
        <div class="hook__title">The Canal Cache</div>
        <p class="hook__desc">
          A marked location along the Canal Edge subzone. Someone left
          supplies in a workshop near the waterline before the fog closed in.
          The mark is still visible. Whether the cache is still there is not confirmed.
        </p>
        <span class="hook__tag">Canal Edge &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a class="hook-card" href="/dispatch/lasalle-pressure-night/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block;">
        <div class="hook__signal">&#x25A0; Pressure Event</div>
        <div class="hook__title">The LaSalle Pressure Night</div>
        <p class="hook__desc">
          Movement from LaSalle peaked overnight on February 1st.
          The Angrignon Fringe absorbed the initial surge.
          The Jolicoeur line reported contact. Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard held.
        </p>
        <span class="hook__tag">Angrignon Fringe &rarr;</span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── CLOSING ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <blockquote style="border-left: 2px solid var(--oxblood); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-dim); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.75;">
        &ldquo;The enclave holds because the canal holds. If the canal line breaks,
        Saint-Paul-&Eacute;mard is not a sector anymore. It is a corridor
        between two worse places.&rdquo;
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>
